    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNestled in a picturesque coastal setting, this charming four-bedroom bungalow exudes timeless elegance and offers a serene retreat from the bustling world. The moment you approach, the sight of the shimmering sea in the distance draws you in, setting the stage for a tranquil and breathtaking living experience.\n\nAs you step inside, you're greeted by a warm and inviting atmosphere, thanks to the seamless transition between indoor and outdoor spaces. The two reception rooms, strategically positioned at the front of the house, are designed to capture stunning sea views. Large windows allow natural light to flood the rooms while providing uninterrupted vistas of the Sea beyond. Imagine sipping your morning coffee or enjoying a book while basking in the changing colours of the sea and sky.\nThe interior exudes a harmonious blend of comfort and style. Soft, neutral tones on the walls complement the hardwood flooring that stretches throughout the living spaces. Elegant furnishings, and tasteful decor, create an inviting ambiance that encourages relaxation and connection.\nThe four bedrooms are havens of tranquillity, each uniquely designed to provide a sense of personal retreat. Soft, plush carpets create a cozy underfoot feel, and large windows invite natural light while offering glimpses of the surrounding landscape. The master bedroom, with an en-suite bathroom and walk-in-wardrobe, provides a luxurious oasis where you can unwind and rejuvenate.\nIn essence, this lovely four-bedroom bungalow is a sanctuary where the beauty of nature seamlessly blends with the comforts of modern living. Its prime location, two reception rooms with sea views, and well-designed spaces make it a captivating and desirable coastal retreat."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nStep through the front door to this wide and bright hallway with solid timber flooring and sea views to the front.\n\nLiving Room - \nThis wonderful reception room - with magnificent sea views - is very spacious and beautifully decorated. Solid timber flooring adds warmth to the room while the large bay window overlooks the super green are to the front of the house with views to the golf club and sea beyond. There is a lovely open fire set with the black slate fireplace and double doors open to the hallway.\n\nFamily Room - \nLarge second reception room with sea views to the front. Ideal for use as a play room, home office or den.\n\nKitchen / Dining - \nExtremely spacious, with extensive fitted units at both floor and wall level. This is the perfect family kitchen, with ample space for cooking, entertaining and family get togethers. With tiled flooring and glazed doors opening to the sheltered and private deck, this room has all the space you might want both inside and out.\n\nUtility Room - \nWith excellent additional storage space, plumbed for washing machine and tumble dryer and direct access to the rear garden.\n\nGuest wc - \nWith tiled floor, wc and whb.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nLarge double bedroom with fitted wardrobes\n\nBedroom 2 - \nVery spacious double bedroom with fitted wardrobes and garden views to side.\n\nBathroom - \nVery large family bathroom with bath, shower, wc and whb. Tiled flooring and part tiled walls.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nWonderful double bedroom with garden views and extensive fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 4 (Main) - \nThis gorgeous master bedroom benefits from lovely garden views and is flooded with light through the large bay window. Fully carpeted and tastefully decorated, this is a haven of relaxation. There is a spacious walk in wardrobes, and ensuite shower room adjacent.\n\nEnsuite - \nWith tiled flooring, part tiled walls and fitted with wc, whb and shower.\n\n"
      },
